        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>My car won't start after sitting in a business park car park all day — is that a breakdown?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Yes — a flat battery or a car that won't turn over both count. Call us with the site name and where in the car park you're parked, and we'll advise whether it's a quick fix on the spot or a full recovery.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Do you cover the road out towards Alford, not just Westhill itself?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Yes, we cover the wider Aberdeenshire road network around Westhill, including the route towards Alford and Deeside. Tell us your nearest village or junction and we'll work out the best way to reach you.</p>
          </details>
